{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/logo.png?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Face  waves of giant insects, aliens, and zombies in a fight for survival. Customize your build with an arsenal of unique weapons and power-ups, and harness the game's unique planetary perspective to outmaneuver your enemies and turn the tide of battle. How long can you last against the cosmic onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/1.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a skilled bounty hunter with a powerful tank, hired by planets desperate to reclaim their land from invaders. Your mission: exterminate the monstrous threats and make the planets habitable for settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every monster you eliminate, you earn a bounty, which can be used to upgrade your weapons, tank, and abilities\u2014allowing you to tackle even greater challenges and amass even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/2.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn them with a flamethrower!,\u00a0exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!,\u00a0protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/7.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/vehicles.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real spherical mini planets arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast runs (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of weapons and powerups to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to trade for items with the merchant drone between waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different difficulty levels so everybody can enjoy it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's in the demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo only has one vehicle and only the first run. In the full game, you will be able to unlock 7 other vehicles, play in different planets and fight against many different creatures and bosses. Also, the demo only has the survival mode. In the full game, you will have access to other game modes, such as the <strong>Planet Purge </strong>in which you will have to clean planets from the monsters invading them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830010?t=1750962080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/f6100ce96ffdc893ba78b96bf1ac71d3d5b4b54d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750962080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/f6dd820554634ca776384b5ce55acf8df4979f88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750962080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/f6dd820554634ca776384b5ce55acf8df4979f88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750962080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/logo.png?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Face  waves of giant insects, aliens, and zombies in a fight for survival. Customize your build with an arsenal of unique weapons and power-ups, and harness the game's unique planetary perspective to outmaneuver your enemies and turn the tide of battle. How long can you last against the cosmic onslaught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/1.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a skilled bounty hunter with a powerful tank, hired by planets desperate to reclaim their land from invaders. Your mission: exterminate the monstrous threats and make the planets habitable for settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For every monster you eliminate, you earn a bounty, which can be used to upgrade your weapons, tank, and abilities\u2014allowing you to tackle even greater challenges and amass even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/2.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn them with a flamethrower!,\u00a0exterminate them with guided missiles and cannon projectiles!,\u00a0protect from enemy bullets with your energy shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/7.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete runs and unlock new vehicles with special and unique abilities\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/extras/vehicles.gif?t=1750962080\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twin-stick shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real spherical mini planets arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast runs (under 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of weapons and powerups to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to trade for items with the merchant drone between waves of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different difficulty levels so everybody can enjoy it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's in the demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo only has one vehicle and only the first run. In the full game, you will be able to unlock 7 other vehicles, play in different planets and fight against many different creatures and bosses. Also, the demo only has the survival mode. In the full game, you will have access to other game modes, such as the <strong>Planet Purge </strong>in which you will have to clean planets from the monsters invading them.</p>","developers":["TuanisApps"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3368550","name":"Panzer Planet"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/33a62e20e872b98ea7658e385416dcc50e187730/header.jpg?t=1750962080","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158449,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158449/movie480.mp4?t=1750962078","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158449/movie_max.mp4?t=1750962078"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158449/8c3d2b4951262ea7b5e4d9333cd4868cf22f754f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750962078","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158449/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750962078","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158449/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750962078"}}],"name":"Panzer Planet Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["TuanisApps"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"26 Jun, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830010/bd6caedf5e30858b29569176d23f963ff46976b1/ss_