,"short_description":"Fast-paced, twin sticker, top-down arena shooter with roguelite elements, where you pilot a powerful tank on spherical mini planets to fight hordes of zombies and monsters. Collect your bounty for killing your enemies to get new weapons and powerups to improve your skills.","steam_appid":3830010,"support_info":{"email":"jeudy@tuanisapps.com","url":"https://www.tuanisapps.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":null}